From 44b728cfe3bc89c49281004d329f12cc1283485d Mon Sep 17 00:00:00 2001
From: Redesign <dev@example.com>
Date: Wed, 18 Nov 2026 08:58:47 +0000
Subject: [PATCH] Frontend redesign: design tokens, responsive shell, shared UI
 primitives, polished screens

- globals.css rewritten around design tokens (colour, radius, shadow, status, layout); class names unchanged
- AppShell: pinnable icon rail, mobile top bar + drawer, breadcrumbs, skip link, aria-current
- New components/ui: Icons, Skeleton, EmptyState, PageHeader, StatCard, Toast
- Login: branded two-panel layout
- Dashboard: icon/tone stat cards, skeletons, empty state
- Invoice Manager: labelled filter bar, skeleton table, empty state, review screen polish
- Supplier Profile: searchable supplier cards, tabbed ledger
- Purchase Analytics / Cash Planner: header, warn card, worked-sum layout, skeletons
- lib/api.ts, lib/types.ts, lib/money.ts untouched
